{
  "_provenance": {
    "what": "The vid each live (mainnet) FurtherFP DVN contract returns, read on chain. DVN.verify/execute reject call data whose packed vid differs, so the signed vid must equal this value.",
    "sources": {
      "dvnAddresses": "supplied by the operator for the FurtherFP DVN on each chain; each EVM address is listed as `FurtherFP` for that chain in https://metadata.layerzero-api.com/v1/metadata/dvns?environment=mainnet (`metadataEntry`); `metadataChain` is that response's chain key where it differs from this service's chain name",
      "evm": "eth_call vid() (selector 0xcf34c768 = keccak256(\"vid()\")[:4]) at block tag latest against the public RPC listed per row, after eth_chainId matched the chain",
      "aptos": "POST /v1/view {function: <dvn>::dvn::get_vid} (lz-v2 aptos workers/dvn/sources/dvn.move: universal_config::eid() % 30_000)",
      "sui": "GraphQL simulateTransaction of `dvn::vid(&DVN)` on the DVN object, whose type is 0x60d4...::dvn::DVN (lz-v2 sui workers/dvns/dvn/sources/dvn.move)"
    },
    "result": "every vid equals the EndpointV1 id of the chain (EVM, Aptos) or the EndpointV2 id modulo 30000 (Sui, which has no EndpointV1 id), as `runtime_v_id_by_chain_name` signs for mainnet",
    "howToRegenerate": "POST eth_chainId then eth_call {to: <dvn>, data: 0xcf34c768} to each rpc; no key needed. Aptos and Sui as above."
  },
